MODULE: ReadPositionHonestArmsWithoutClaim
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
EXPECT: clean (a redundancy check: the guard is implied in the model and kept for the reason in LiveAdvanceDesign.md)
SUMMARY: an activation arms without a claim
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance
BOUNDS: WithGateFlip = TRUE, WithBatch = FALSE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
Armed(a) ==
    /\ cstage[a] = 3

--- REPLACE
Armed(a) ==
--- END
